{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcda <u>About This Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this library management simulation game, you start with nothing but an empty room and a few books. Your goal is to design and manage a fully functional library from the ground up, where every decision\u2014from layout to membership plans\u2014shapes how your space operates and grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place furniture, arrange shelves, and customize the environment to reflect your own vision. Whether you're creating a quiet reading nook, a modern study area, or a sprawling multi-room facility, you're free to build the kind of library you want to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your visitor base grows, you'll register new members, manage book types, and set up personalized subscription systems. Using an in-game computer interface, you'll handle purchases, pricing, and service upgrades to keep your library running efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a blend of creative freedom and thoughtful management, giving you the tools to create a unique library experience and the responsibility to keep it functioning smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong><u>What You\u2019ll Be Doing:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Build &amp; Decorate</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose where every shelf, desk, decoration and even lights goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691520/extras/Decorate2.gif?t=1746090418\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> \ud83e\uddcd <strong>Register Members</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Speak with the customers to learn their needs and make them member of your dream library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691520/extras/Register.gif?t=1746090418\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddfe <strong>Manage Subscriptions</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Create and edit tariff plans for your members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691520/extras/TarifeSe\u00e7.gif?t=1746090418\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcda<strong>Fill the bookshelves.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock your bookshelves with a wide variety of book types; choose whichever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691520/extras/Kitap-yerle\u015ftirme.gif?t=1746090418\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Use the In-Game Computer</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Run software for register members, customize library, book orders, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Grow Your Library</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Expand your space and your services as popularity increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Your dream library is just a few shelves away. Design it your way and fill it with stories.\ud83d\ude42</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691520?t=1746090418","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691520?t=1746090418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691520/7f5a7677ffb9e18c1f733052c94797b984f66913/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746090418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691520/7f5a7677ffb9e18c1f733052c94797b984f66913/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746090418","categories":[{"descrip